    "northStar": "The Quiet Control Room",
    "overview": "A card-based monitoring dashboard: big quiet cards on a soft ground, one indigo accent, data that reads at a glance. The base tokens come from Reroute's Night Dispatcher; the dashboard layer is Mycelium's own.",
